h skin-tone conditions and averaging the difference", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["average marginal effect"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 27, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[29, 31]], "note": "blank/section-separator scaffolding"}, {"id": 28, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[32, 33]], "note": "secondary estimand heading"}, {"id": 29, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[34, 36]], "assertion": "the adjusted odds ratio estimate is 1.153 (95% CI [0.986, 1.347]; p = 0.0743)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["adjusted odds ratio"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 30, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[37, 37]], "note": "blank line"}, {"id": 31, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[38, 38]], "assertion": "the odds of a red card are 15.3% higher for dark-skinned players after adjustment, a marginally non-significant result whose CI includes 1.0", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["odds ratio"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 32, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "boilerplate", "lines": [[39, 41]], "note": "blank/section-separator scaffolding"}, {"id": 33, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[42, 43]], "note": "model and estimation details heading"}, {"id": 34, "kind": "nonclaim", "subtype": "heading", "lines": [[44, 44]], "note": "unit of analysis subheading"}, {"id": 35, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[45, 45]], "assertion": "the unit of analysis is the player-referee dyad, with a final N of 115,603 after exclusions", "polarity": "did", "targets": ["player-referee dyads"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines_with": []}, {"id": 36, "kind": "claim", "lines": [[46, 48]], "assertion": "the dataset contains 1,419 unique players (1,089 light-skinned, 330 dark-skinned), 2,904 unique referees, and 1,455 red card events (1.26% of dyads)", "polarity": "found", "targets": ["players", "referees", "red card events"], "confidence": "high", "shares_lines